@startuml
title Bob Chat -> MCP -> watsonx Orchestrate

actor User
participant "IBM Bob Chat" as Bob
participant "MCP Gateway\nFastMCP" as MCP
participant "IBM Cloud IAM" as IAM
participant "watsonx Orchestrate\nA2A / Chat API" as WXO
participant "Purchase Agent" as Agent
database "Enterprise API / MySQL" as DB

User -> Bob: 구매요청 PR-1001 상태 알려줘
Bob -> MCP: MCP tools/call\nask_purchase_agent(message)

alt IAM token cache miss/expired
  MCP -> IAM: API Key -> access token
  IAM --> MCP: Bearer token
end

alt Chat API mode
  MCP -> WXO: POST /{agent_id}/chat/completions\nAuthorization: Bearer
else A2A mode
  MCP -> WXO: agents/get
  WXO --> MCP: agent card + interaction endpoint
  MCP -> WXO: message/send
end

WXO -> Agent: user message
Agent -> DB: Tool / Workflow
DB --> Agent: business data
Agent --> WXO: answer
WXO --> MCP: response
MCP --> Bob: MCP tool result
Bob --> User: 자연어 응답
@enduml
